Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_apache
Fix: Load mod_evasive and tune DOSPageCount/DOSSiteCount.
References: Apache Module mod_evasive
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6, CM-7; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The evasive module is not loaded: flooding requests are answered at
full speed, and a slow client holds a worker. Load mod_evasive (a
separate package on most distributions) and tune DOSPageCount and
DOSSiteCount for this host. Withheld where the configuration loads
no modules by name: a statically built server may carry it inside.
